","Statistics","Python","MATLAB/Simulation","AI for Materials Discovery"]},{"type":"h","text":"Industry"},{"type":"flow","items":["Scale-up","Product Development","Quality","Manufacturing","Technology Transfer"]},{"type":"h","text":"Sustainability"},{"type":"flow","items":["Recycling","Circular Economy","LCA","Bio-based Materials","Decarbonisation"]},{"type":"h","text":"Target Profile"},{"type":"flow","items":["Polymer Engineer","Materials R&D Specialist","Product Development Engineer","Sustainable Materials Researcher"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"This pathway can lead from industrial polymer/product development into advanced materials, sustainable plastics, automotive materials, specialty chemicals, energy materials and eventually principal-level R&D or technology leadership."}]}]}